**No shortcuts.** Do not put a rule in to raise a day’s %. The Handle has to work on **almost every name** — same gene, this temperament — not a two-day fit. When they ask for a day’s %, that is **this** book, not a juiced sit. Durable enough until alpha decay; then repair or move on. Not a decades claim.

**Store** what has no reason to go in yet. Know it. As more names print, **connect** — a later extra can unlock an earlier one. Store is not a queue to dump in.

**Do add:** same gene, letter clip already locked, something sitting on it (pooled 1m 25% vs 5A 10%). Tell them what moved.

**TNON is not a veto. Aug 12 is not a pet.** Add if the **stretch mean** rises — or the reds shrink — on days that are not the one we are reviewing. A TNON nick is fine if the mean still goes up. Do **not** add a rule that only lifts Aug 12 / 19 and taxes the rest. Ignore-stop dropped Aug 19; leave it.

Not a new letter. Hunt extras still wait for the same extra, same gene, **three names**.
